# {{title}} feedback rounds

The client consolidates feedback through one named contact (`C1`) per review.
Each round records what was reviewed, the question asked and how every comment
was resolved. Rules: [project operations](../../business/engagement-operations.md#feedback-rounds-and-revision-limits).

